WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.480
Uranus is the seventh planet from the Sun.

00:02.892 --> 00:05.425
It is a gaseous cyan-coloured ice giant.

00:05.827 --> 00:14.434
Most of the planet is made of water, ammonia, and methane in a supercritical phase of matter, which astronomers call "ice" or "volatiles".

00:14.917 --> 00:23.147
The planet's atmosphere has a complex layered cloud structure, and has the lowest minimum temperature of all of the Solar System's planets.

00:23.855 --> 00:33.049
It has a marked axial tilt of 82.23°, with a retrograde rotation period of 17 hours and 14 minutes.
